## Build order
1. Build the pipeline (5 stages) first.
2. Build the workflow trigger + Step 1 (create opportunity), test a booking lands in "Discovery Call Booked."
3. Add confirmation (Step 2), test it fires.
4. Add reminders (Steps 3–4) with event-relative waits.
5. Add the no-show if/else (Step 5) last.
6. End-to-end test: book a test slot → confirm opportunity + confirmation → (optionally) verify a no-show fires by leaving a test opportunity in "Booked" past its time.

